### 1-2. 핵심 폼(Form) 컴포넌트
**파일 경로:** `src/app/reservations/new/NewReservationForm.tsx`

**주요 상태 관리:**
```typescript
const form = useForm<NewReservationFormValues>({
  resolver: zodResolver(newReservationFormSchema),
  defaultValues: {
    title: "",
    booker: "",
